# Branch naming

- Never create or suggest branches starting with `cursor/`.
- Use short, semantic names that describe the change, e.g. `staff-ops-shell-ux`, `tracker-qr-scan`, `fix-fleet-map-jump`.
- Prefer `feature/…`, `fix/…`, or a plain kebab-case topic over tool/vendor prefixes.
